  "title": "ADMT Deployer Notice Before Consequential Decision",
  "content": "Beginning January 1, 2027, before a consequential decision is made using covered automated decision-making technology, the deployer must notify the consumer that an automated system is in use and disclose the purpose and nature of the decision. The notice is pre-decision; a post-hoc disclosure does not satisfy it.",
